fragment_downloaded_cb({"url":"gl/gstglutils.html#gst_gl_dma_buf_transform_drm_formats_to_gst_formats","fragment":"\n\tgst_gl_dma_buf_transform_drm_formats_to_gst_formats\n\n\n\tGstGL.prototype.gl_dma_buf_transform_drm_formats_to_gst_formats\n\n\n\tGstGL.gl_dma_buf_transform_drm_formats_to_gst_formats\n\nGiven the DRM formats in src GValue, collect corresponding GST formats to\ndst GValue. This function returns FALSE if  the context is not an EGL\ncontext.\nParameters:\na GstContext\nvalue of \"drm-format\" field in GstCaps as GValue\ntransformation flags\nempty destination GValue\nwhether any valid GST video formats were found and stored in dst\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.26\n\t\t\nGiven the DRM formats in src GObject.Value, collect corresponding GST formats to\ndst GObject.Value. This function returns false if  the context is not an EGL\ncontext.\nParameters:\na Gst.Context\nvalue of \"drm-format\" field in Gst.Caps as GObject.Value\ntransformation flags\nempty destination GObject.Value\nReturns a tuple made of:\nwhether any valid GST video formats were found and stored in dst\nwhether any valid GST video formats were found and stored in dst\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.26\n\t\t\nGiven the DRM formats in src GObject.Value, collect corresponding GST formats to\ndst GObject.Value. This function returns False if  the context is not an EGL\ncontext.\nParameters:\na Gst.Context\nvalue of \"drm-format\" field in Gst.Caps as GObject.Value\ntransformation flags\nempty destination GObject.Value\nReturns a tuple made of:\nwhether any valid GST video formats were found and stored in dst\nwhether any valid GST video formats were found and stored in dst\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.26\n\t\t\n"});